  (text "C8 with Rf: 529 Hz at maximum Gain\nRf/R31 = 1 (min), ~30 (noon), 304 (max)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 139.7 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2cd92be0-239d-568b-bee9-3b91a20ad143"))
  (text "Rf = RVX1 + RX4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 99.06 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "847a9664-dc11-525e-9908-682c75653c5c"))
  (text "Sections 3 and 4 of the circuit notes. G = 1 + (Rf/R31) HP(1.46 kHz) LP(Rf, C8): bass passes near unity, the upper register is driven.\nR31, C10, C8: values reported by a mod [2]; their position in a non-inverting stage is inferred (the standard topology).\nUX2: the core is reported as a discrete two-stage circuit [4]; an ideal op-amp stands in for its small-signal behaviour (chosen).\nRVX1, RX4: Gain pot and series resistor (chosen, section 4): 1 MOhm log, about 10 % of its value at noon.\nStage 1 headroom: the DSP soft-limits at +/-4 V around VB on the 9 V supply (railV, chosen, section 5)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d22bb5aa-f10a-5160-b947-3d0aee99ef5d"))
